[en.DECISION_C22_WORLD_EXPO_3_LP_TO]
> Enter the Steam Engine Venue

[en.DECISION_C22_WORLD_EXPO_3_LP_TO_desc]
The steam engine venue mainly showcases the steam engine technology from the Las Pegasus Consortium and its subsidiaries, including early prototypes, evolution, some industrial applications, and brass crafts.

(There is a line of inconspicuous small print below: Visiting the steam engine venue requires a separate ticket. Our staff will verify your ticket at the exit. Visitors without tickets or any purchases may face a fine of up to three times the ticket price. The final interpretation right belongs to the Las Pegasus Consortium.)

[zh.DECISION_C22_WORLD_EXPO_3_LP_TO]
> 前往蒸汽机会场

[zh.DECISION_C22_WORLD_EXPO_3_LP_TO_desc]
蒸汽机会场主要展示来自于洛马基财团及旗下公司的蒸汽机技术，包括蒸汽机早期原型、演变过程、一些工业应用以及黄铜工艺品。

（下面写着一行不起眼的小字：参观蒸汽机会场需要单独购票，我们的员工将在出口处对您的门票进行验证，无票参观且不消费者可能面临高达三倍的门票价格的罚款。最终解释权归洛马基财团所有。）
